{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.TowerPairEqualityFixedLevel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.TowerPairEqualityFixedLevel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TowerPairEqualitySymmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TowerPairEqualitySymmetric","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L65-L79","doc":"Sanity: the pair-contribution formula is symmetric under\nrelabelling of the index set's elements. The underlying\n`Finset.sum` is invariant under bijection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.TowerPairEqualityFixedLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.TowerPairEqualityFixedLevel","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L49-L62","doc":"**Pair-contribution equality at fixed jet level.**\n\nThe level-$n$ pair contribution is an *equality*, not an upper\nbound. As an `Eq` in the coefficient ring, this is automatic\nfrom the structure of `pairContribTotal`. The lemma exists to\nclose the GAP 17b \"is this an equality?\" question with a\none-line proof, replacing the prose \"pentagon upper bound\"\nframing with the categorical fact that the formula is an\nequality by construction. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:tower-pair-equality-fixed-level","label":"lem:tower-pair-equality-fixed-level","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.pairContribTotal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.pairContribTotal","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L43-L47","doc":"The level-$n$ pair contribution as a Finset sum:\n`pairs_n = z² · Σ_{(i,j) ∈ P_n} Φ_q(|V̂_i V̂_j|)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.zSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.zSq","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.pairContrib","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.pairContrib","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.PnFinset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.PnFinset","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.Pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.Pn","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JetLevelPairData","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/tower-pair-equality-fixed-level.lean#L29-L41","doc":"Abstract per-level data for the pair contribution.\n\n`R` is the coefficient ring (instantiated as `ℤ[q^{±1/2}, z]`\nin the QOU narrative). `Pn` is the index set of pair blow-up\ncentres at jet level `n` (the full set of unordered pairs\n`{(i, j) : i < j ∧ i, j < n_factors}`).\n`pairContrib (i, j)` is the value `Φ_q(|V̂_i V̂_j|)` for the\ngiven pair. `zSq` is `z²` from the Markov parameter. ","signatureChunk":0}]}